source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: The scan past a hidden closer runs over a later `{{`, so one span forms whose body swallows the second opener; jiro pairs the same braces and reads one literal backslash where Jira renders a forced newline.
-- input.jira --
{{a\\}} {{b}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt>a<br class="atl-forced-newline" />}} {{b</tt></p>
-- want.md --
`a\}} {{b`
-- warnings.json --
[]
